# Cloudflare Pages Redirects File
# Format: /source-path /target-path [status-code]
# Status code is optional, defaults to 301 (Permanent Redirect). Supports 301, 302, 200 (Rewrite), etc.
#
# Examples:
# /old-page          /new-page
# /about-us          /about
# /external-link     https://example.com          302
# /blog/:slug        /posts/:slug                 301
